MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Holiday Spirits connects my repeated interest in Christmas albums with the listening I continued in The New Old Fashioned, making it my strongest choice.",
    "It's Entertainment feels like a recognizable follow-up to The New Old Fashioned, while That's Christmas To Me gives me another clear connection to albums I have chosen repeatedly."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "I cannot connect titles such as Heritage, Hope, and The Definitive Collection to my listening with enough confidence to choose them; that uncertainty matters because I rarely try something without a clear reason.",
    "A Lesley Gore retrospective or a duets collection does not follow naturally from my recent choices just because it is another music collection."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The list seems to treat broad collections and familiar older music as enough of a connection, although those qualities alone do not explain my choices.",
    "It seems to stretch my interest in particular albums into an interest in loosely related music, when I need a more recognizable link before I will listen."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My Christmas album choices were clustered together in November 2014; they show a holiday interest, but my later choice of The New Old Fashioned also matters for what I might want next.",
    "The strongest recommendations connect both parts of my history: my Christmas listening and the musical connection I recognize from The New Old Fashioned."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You understood my interest in Christmas albums and recognizable follow-ups, but stretched that interest too far toward collections with no clear personal connection."
}
